a formal notice should come.

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:26.130
I'll be in touch with more details soon.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:29.500
That's all for now. Good luck.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:37.510
Huh?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.500
I feel like bragging about you to someone

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:39.500
Am I...

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:43.290
I finally know what ran off and disappeared

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:42.500
actually... upset over this?

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:52.380
It wasn't somebody's depressing words

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:47.670
Yamashiro-san?

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:52.880
It's dangerous over there.

00:18:52.880 --> 00:19:00.630
Only those few words you casually spoke

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:04.250
Made me realize

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:09.340
Miracles are by no means a rarity

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:17.500
If our sorrow is to continue on

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:19.040
It's just... if I knew I would feel so much regret,
I should have worked harder from the start.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:22.000
Then it's alright if we just forget that

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:25.660
It's okay to cry and yell out

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:31.210
Let's spend every day like that

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:28.380
Sitting around trying to decide
what part of this job I actually liked...

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:35.880
All that free time... I should have just used it
to do the damn work.

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:40.130
When we realize that someone's kindness was a lie

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:38.800
It's too late, even if I start now.

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:47.510
It's always something that hurts us inside

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:48.550
That's not the way to do it.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:51.210
It's because you're bending your arms too much.

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:59.170
But you can't let that misery reach the heart

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:59.170
If you do your job in a way you might regret,
you'll end up regretting it even worse in the end.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:05.170
You know, the things that we've lost over time

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:09.000
Probably won't be found again

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:12.040
We've accepted that fact

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:17.670
That's why, oh, even someone like me

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:20.370
When did I become like this?

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:25.920
Feels like boasting to the world about you

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:25.920
Maybe it was back... when I realized
I wouldn't be doing what I wanted to.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:32.410
I finally know what disappeared into the night

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.410
Yes, hello?

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.710
More than our sorrowful memories

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.160
Hello? It's me.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:37.460
More than our sorrowful memories

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:40.000
Sorry, I'm in the middle of proofreading now.
I'll call you back later.

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:47.000
What changed my heart was your precious words

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.870
Hey, Tanaka! I told you to get this faxed!

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:50.370
Nobody is by any means special

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:55.760
Then it's alright if we just don't sing

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:54.550
I see. Then it'll just have to wait.

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:55.750
What's wrong?

00:20:55.750 --> 00:21:03.830
It's alright if we forget

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:59.410
I don't know if I'll enjoy my next job.

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:01.870
Did something happen?

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:07.750
But regardless of whether I do or not,
I don't want to leave any regrets.

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:17.290
Spending every day like that is just fine

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:09.250
That's what I think.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.790
And that's what I'll...

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.300
I'll tell you when we meet later.

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:18.340
Yeah. I swear I won't be late this time.

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:32.420
Shangri-la

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:37.670
Even in my dreams you can't manage a proper smile

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:43.000
I just want to chide and love a hopeless person like you

00:21:46.210 --> 00:21:49.960
Today I thought about you and now I can't sleep

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:53.540
Where shall we go?

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:59.000
Ahh... ahh...

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.260
Shangri-la

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:06.210
Let me hear you shout "I'm happy!"

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:10.540
Let me see the tears underneath your tough exterior

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:12.210
Shangri-la

00:22:12.210 --> 00:22:17.170
Today I thought about you and now I can't sleep

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:22.210
Please chide and love a hopeless person like me

00:22:21.710 --> 00:22:25.460
Shinji
Nice Work Today
Do your best, but don't
wear yourself out.
-Shinji

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:35.830
Next Episode: Double Back Man
